  "_comment": "How to find each catalog's winner on the event's English Wikipedia page. page: title pattern ({ord} = ordinal edition, {year} = event year). edition_base: edition number = year - edition_base. mode table = ceremony winners tables (winner listed first, in bold); mode line = festival award lists. year_offset: catalog year = event year + offset. last_event_year: newest event already in the catalog.",
